{"data": [{"author_id": "1472862857989877762", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:39:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120315363657138231"], "id": "2120315363657138231", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 收藏 1.4 万，估计真跑的没几个，我今晚就拿老项目试一遍", "url": "https://x.com/juzipic/status/2120315363657138231"}, {"author_id": "2042192369869545472", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:26:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120312148702400935"], "id": "2120312148702400935", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 太有用啦", "url": "https://x.com/chenchen198663/status/2120312148702400935"}, {"author_id": "1345570459736129536", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:26:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120312085607588121"], "id": "2120312085607588121", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2041558487772086272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120204696187248845", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ynqjn25283 @bozhou_ai 那些脚手架确实多余了 模型自己就能干 之前白折腾", "url": "https://x.com/WillsonMa1/status/2120312085607588121"}, {"author_id": "1891833767519715329", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:05:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120306826021662845"], "id": "2120306826021662845", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 同一提示词跑两遍、对比输出差异才是干货，收藏1.4万大概率只收藏不实测，GitHub星标同理", "url": "https://x.com/YunTechX/status/2120306826021662845"}, {"author_id": "1390955686142517249", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:57:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120304949200589303"], "id": "2120304949200589303", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 让模型从新角度检查项目挺有启发，但一次通读不保证找出所有问题。生成的修改先审查差异，再跑相关测试，别直接全盘接受。", "url": "https://x.com/KevinWeb3Nomad/status/2120304949200589303"}, {"author_id": "519106341", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:42:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120301001857171527"], "id": "2120301001857171527", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 清单里加一列影响范围，会更好下手。", "url": "https://x.com/Sir03834855/status/2120301001857171527"}, {"author_id": "1449292383741362178", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:35:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120284130441326617"], "id": "2120284130441326617", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 不错，项目随着模型能力增加，也不断迭代升级👍", "url": "https://x.com/Bighead815/status/2120284130441326617"}, {"author_id": "2112068973969965056", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:07:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120262111117095318"], "id": "2120262111117095318", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 收藏比点赞还多，今晚拿自己的项目跑一遍试试。", "url": "https://x.com/susan16808/status/2120262111117095318"}, {"author_id": "417508671", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:40:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120225052121838043"], "id": "2120225052121838043", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai You had me at “no longer needed.” Less code to maintain is a lovely upgrade.", "url": "https://x.com/thesimaximalist/status/2120225052121838043"}, {"author_id": "1949157978558664704", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:27:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120221743252140366"], "id": "2120221743252140366", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 清单出来后我会先只挑一两项修，别把“发现了很多问题”直接变成一大包改动。一次动几十处，最后就算测试挂了，也很难分清是哪一项出了问题。体检和手术可以分两次做。", "url": "https://x.com/Talljackcv/status/2120221743252140366"}, {"author_id": "1282438260883509250", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:13:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120218244393164856"], "id": "2120218244393164856", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 177, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 我拿类似的全项目通读跑过一个27万token的老仓库，它确实点出三处早期架构债，但也把两个已删模块当成还在用，误报占四成。真正有用的是先让它只输出文件清单和依赖关系，你核对完再谈结论，否则读得越多编得越顺。", "url": "https://x.com/hppzyy/status/2120218244393164856"}, {"author_id": "2110892324003725312", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:06:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120216479593300154"], "id": "2120216479593300154", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai Good habit. Run it on a throwaway branch so every \"fix\" is a reviewable diff, and keep a short log of what changed, which tests ran and what you rejected. Workflow checklists: https://t.co/57dO8ZIqYw #ClaudeCode #vibecoding", "url": "https://x.com/vibeforgelabs/status/2120216479593300154"}, {"author_id": "2066846388848308224", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:38:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120209507221696806"], "id": "2120209507221696806", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 这招挺实用  周末我也拿项目试一遍", "url": "https://x.com/JhonDennisxiud/status/2120209507221696806"}, {"author_id": "2041558487772086272", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:19:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120204696187248845"], "id": "2120204696187248845", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai 有道理。很多我们之前自以为有用的脚手架，现在随着模型的迭代进化，以及各个 Agent 的 harness 做得越来越好，我们已经不太需要这些自以为有用的脚手架和 skill 了。", "url": "https://x.com/ynqjn25283/status/2120204696187248845"}, {"author_id": "2080521898623160320", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:03:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120185562426732972"], "id": "2120185562426732972", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717726640040783872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120133447167639746", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bozhou_ai The \"fix what you're sure about\" split is the part that actually matters. Left unbounded, a full-repo audit prompt tends to rewrite half the codebase and bury the real issues in a giant diff. I'd add one line: don't touch anything outside the files you flag.", "url": "https://x.com/ModelPlaneHQ/status/2120185562426732972"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1472862857989877762", "name": "juzipi", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 56, "following_count": 163, "like_count": 174, "listed_count": 2, "media_count": 42, "tweet_count": 482}, "username": "juzipic"}, {"id": "2042192369869545472", "name": "Chen.exe", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 23, "following_count": 73, "like_count": 472, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 41, "tweet_count": 858}, "username": "chenchen198663"}, {"id": "1345570459736129536", "name": "Mr马总｜代举报｜", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 8802, "following_count": 3841, "like_count": 537, "listed_count": 24, "media_count": 208, "tweet_count": 28466}, "username": "WillsonMa1"}, {"id": "1891833767519715329", "name": "Hale", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 2474, "following_count": 1988, "like_count": 3093, "listed_count": 2, "media_count": 42, "tweet_count": 6325}, "username": "YunTechX"}, {"id": "1390955686142517249", "name": "Kevin Lin", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 3151, "following_count": 2976, "like_count": 886, "listed_count": 1, "media_count": 64, "tweet_count": 28287}, "username": "KevinWeb3Nomad"}, {"id": "519106341", "name": "loker", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 20, "following_count": 103, "like_count": 95, "listed_count": 1, "media_count": 6, "tweet_count": 133}, "username": "Sir0383